<title>JAPAN: Aderans boosted by earnings revision.</title>
<headline>Aderans boosted by earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Aderans Co Ltd were higher in mid-morning Tuesday trade on the second section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange, after the company revised up its earnings forecast on Monday, brokers said.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 70 yen at 2,950 yen at 0128 GMT on a turnover of 80,000.</p>
<p>The wig maker raised its parent current earnings forecast for the year to February 28, 1997, to 8.80 billion yen from 8.00 billion yen.</p>
</text>
